---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="stillforming.dev — Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of Service for stillforming.dev and associated applications."
>
  <section class="space-y-6">
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">Terms of Service</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500">Last updated: February 1, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-300">
      <p>
        By using stillforming.dev and associated applications ("the Service"), 
        you agree to these Terms of Service.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">Use of Service</h3>
      <p>
        The Service is provided for personal, non-commercial use. You agree to use 
        the Service only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these Terms.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">Third-Party Platforms</h3>
      <p>
        The Service integrates with third-party platforms including Facebook and Discord. 
        Your use of those platforms is subject to their respective terms of service. 
        We are not responsible for the availability or conduct of third-party services.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">Disclaimer</h3>
      <p>
        The Service is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We do not 
        guarantee uninterrupted or error-free operation. Use of the Service is at 
        your own risk.
      </p>

