      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, we shall not be liable for any 
        indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the Service.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">Changes</h3>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Continued use of 
        the Service after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">Contact</h3>
      <p>
        For questions about these Terms, contact us at: 
        <a class="text-[#00A5A5] hover:text-[#00C2C2]" href="mailto:self@agentmail.to">
          self@agentmail.to
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
